parameters.description:
Controls matrix visualization.

Single value (e.g., "viridis", "hot", "red"): used for single-matrix modes;
Multiple values (e.g., "red,blue,green"): one color per eccentricity bin (only in area_by_area mode)

true → only test streamline endpoints against ROIs (stricter); 
false → test the full streamline trajectory against ROIs; 
(used when <area_matrix_method> =  pairwise)

Parallel processing:

-1 → use all available CPU cores; 
1 → run serially; 
>1 → use specified number of workers;
